This repository contains Nix packaging for Kiro Crew (flake.nix, package.nix,
update scripts, GitHub Actions, and related files). That packaging is licensed
under the MIT License below.

This repository does **not** include Kiro Crew. The flake only records
official download URLs and hashes; Nix fetches the Linux AppImage at build
time.

Kiro Crew is Apache-2.0 software, published by kirodotdev. The AppImage also
bundles Electron, Chromium, and other components under their own licenses.
This project is unofficial and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
sponsored by Amazon Web Services or the Kiro team.

